            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "oem/meta/libpldmresponder/file_io_type_event_log.cpp",
                    "line": 766,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vishnunithyasoundhar S",
                        "email": "vishnunithyasoundhar.s@intel.com",
                        "username": "VishnuNithyaSoundharS"
                    },
                    "message": "cxlEvent creates an Error-severity log when DEASSERTED \u2014 not \"info-level\". You might have to fix the log."
                },
                {
                    "file": "oem/meta/libpldmresponder/file_io_type_event_log.cpp",
                    "line": 766,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Yang",
                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for catching this.\nI changed the message to a generic \"Failed to create D-Bus event log\" since it's shared by both cxlEvent and platformEvent now."
                },
                {
                    "file": "oem/meta/libpldmresponder/file_io_type_event_log.cpp",
                    "line": 770,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vishnunithyasoundhar S",
                        "email": "vishnunithyasoundhar.s@intel.com",
                        "username": "VishnuNithyaSoundharS"
                    },
                    "message": "I am seeing both `cxlEvent` and `platformEvent` basically share 90% of the implementation except the severity. \n\nDo you think it would be better to make a shared helper function, so that both handlers would just become one-liners?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "oem/meta/libpldmresponder/file_io_type_event_log.cpp",
                    "line": 770,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Eric Yang",
                        "email": "eric.yang.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "fornchu110"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for your suggestion.\nI extracted a createEventLog(event, severity) helper. Both cxlEvent and platformEvent now just set their severity and call it."
                }
            ],
            "files": [
                {
